{"articles":[{"no":"第一點","path":[],"text":"宜蘭縣政府（以下簡稱本府）為處理違反公寓大廈管理條例事件，建\n\n    立執法之公平性，減少爭議，提升本府之公信力，特訂定本基準。","id":"宜蘭縣-GL000594/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"d2719a6205f7c3a4870b5b527114bd7725d2ae5e016bad3f2f15506a6e0c0f1d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第二點","path":[],"text":"違反公寓大廈管理條例事件統一裁罰基準如附表。\n圖表附件：附表.pdf","id":"宜蘭縣-GL000594/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"0777cbf8c25045f2adcbbde8cb6805a7fdbf0aa414939fe7d0fcd9bc4d2e7f6c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第三點","path":[],"text":"違規案件依前點基準裁罰，有關連續處罰之基準，第二次罰鍰金額\n\n    以第一次罰鍰金額二倍計算，第三次以上罰鍰金額則以法定罰鍰金\n\n    額上限計算。情節重大或特殊案件，經依行政罰法第十八條規定審\n\n    酌得減輕或加重。","id":"宜蘭縣-GL000594/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"95150ce3fbdf35b2785a6f7ccf2e873bfe2b834314d2b3088f31d72815485ace","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[{"title":"附表.pdf","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=2617&id=GL000594&type=LAW"}],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"宜蘭縣-GL000594","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"","name":"宜蘭縣政府處理違反公寓大廈管理條例事件統一裁罰基準","region":"宜蘭縣","source":"宜蘭縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=GL000594","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:34:42+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"4e7553c4f5e34d9682433eb14b806bdb8e927d34ea3be6b3091fadc6e37e3585","sourceRecordId":"宜蘭縣-GL000594","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-29T00:39:28+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"","effectiveDate":""}}